      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've seen some increasing interest in this lately.  Having avatars dedicated to worlds that can be fed (or deliver?) data with it's paired world(s) for persistent stuff, or like rewards etc that you can take elsewhere or use wherever.\n\nCurrently we don't even have basic stuff like physbone in worlds, so no easily made grabbable dynamic objects (ropes, chains, stretchy things etc)",
